    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ampyx</span></b> , ycis, m., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄμπυξ</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One of the Lapithœ; acc.</i> Ampyca,
				<i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 12, 450</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>One of the companions of Phineus</i>, <i>changed to stone by Perseus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5,
				184</span></i>.</div>
